#: package/contents/ui/ConfigGeneral.qml:140
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Shows rain only if it rains for at least half of the daylight hours, "
"otherwise the better part of the day."
msgstr ""
"Zeigt Regen nur, wenn es mindestens die Hälfte der Tagesstunden regnet, "
"sonst den besseren Teil des Tages."

#: package/contents/ui/ConfigGeneral.qml:141
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Shows rain if it rains for at least a quarter of the daylight hours, "
"otherwise the typical weather of the day."
msgstr ""
"Zeigt Regen, wenn es mindestens ein Viertel der Tagesstunden regnet, sonst "
"das typische Wetter des Tages."

#: package/contents/ui/ConfigGeneral.qml:142
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Shows rain as soon as it rains during daylight, otherwise the worse part of "
"the day."
msgstr ""
"Zeigt Regen, sobald es tagsüber regnet, sonst den schlechteren Teil des "
"Tages."

